WEBVTT

00:01:58.330 --> 00:02:01.863
for humans today
and in future generations,

00:02:01.863 --> 00:02:04.197
while still enjoying
all of the creature comforts

00:02:04.197 --> 00:02:05.763
we've come to expect.

00:02:05.797 --> 00:02:11.263
If we do it at the global scale,
we will get back in balance with nature,

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:13.130
which will be great for humanity

00:02:13.163 --> 00:02:15.530
and will also improve
the health of the planet.

00:02:16.463 --> 00:02:18.297
So how do we do that?

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:20.763
The answer is synthetic biology.

00:02:21.863 --> 00:02:24.530
Now, some of you may be thinking,
"Synthetic biology?

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:28.530
That sounds like an oxymoron at best
and dangerous at worst."

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:32.297
How can something biological,
which is based on nature,